#: main.cpp:26 mainwindow.cpp:21
msgid "NVIDIA Driver Manager"
msgstr "NVIDIA 驱动程序管理器"

#: main.cpp:28
msgid "Manage NVIDIA drivers on Fedora Linux"
msgstr "在 Fedora Linux 上管理 NVIDIA 驱动程序"

#: main.cpp:30
msgid "(C) 2027 KairikiFedora"
msgstr "(C) 2027 KairikiFedora"

#: mainwindow.cpp:38
msgid "Current driver: detecting..."
msgstr "当前驱动：检测中……"

#: mainwindow.cpp:42
msgid "Select Driver Version"
msgstr "选择驱动程序版本"

#: mainwindow.cpp:52
msgid "Configure MOK for Secure Boot (if enabled)"
msgstr "为安全启动配置 MOK（如果已启用）"

#: mainwindow.cpp:56
msgid "Install / Switch Driver"
msgstr "安装 / 切换驱动"

#: mainwindow.cpp:76
msgid "NVIDIA GPU detected ✓"
msgstr "检测到 NVIDIA GPU ✓"

#: mainwindow.cpp:80
msgid "This computer does not need additional drivers."
msgstr "此计算机不需要额外驱动程序。"

#: mainwindow.cpp:88
msgid "Current driver: not installed"
msgstr "当前驱动：未安装"

#: mainwindow.cpp:90
msgid "Current driver: %1"
msgstr "当前驱动：%1"

#: mainwindow.cpp:113
msgid "Already Installed"
msgstr "已安装"

#: mainwindow.cpp:114
msgid ""
"The driver version '%1' is already installed.\n"
"No further action is required."
msgstr ""
"驱动程序版本“%1”已安装。\n"
"无需进一步操作。"

#: mainwindow.cpp:120
msgid "Different Version Installed"
msgstr "已安装不同版本"

#: mainwindow.cpp:121
msgid ""
"You currently have '%1' installed.\n"
"Installing '%2' will replace it (this will remove the old driver package).\n"
"\n"
"Are you sure you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"您当前已安装“%1”。\n"
"安装“%2”将替换它（这将移除旧驱动包）。\n"
"\n"
"确定要继续吗？"

#: mainwindow.cpp:136
msgid "Secure Boot Ignored"
msgstr "已忽略安全启动"

#: mainwindow.cpp:137
msgid ""
"Secure Boot is enabled, but you chose not to configure MOK.\n"
"The driver may fail to load after installation."
msgstr ""
"安全启动已启用，但您选择不配置 MOK。\n"
"安装后驱动程序可能无法加载。"

#: mainwindow.cpp:158
msgid "Confirm Installation"
msgstr "确认安装"

#: mainwindow.cpp:159
msgid ""
"The system will install/switch to the following packages:\n"
"%1\n"
"\n"
"This requires root privileges and may download packages. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"系统将安装/切换到以下软件包：\n"
"%1\n"
"\n"
"此操作需要 root 权限，并可能下载软件包。继续吗？"

#: mainwindow.cpp:168
msgid "Driver Installation Log"
msgstr "驱动程序安装日志"

#: mainwindow.cpp:177
msgid "Close"
msgstr "关闭"

#: mainwindow.cpp:230
msgid "Failed to start pkexec."
msgstr "无法启动 pkexec。"

#: mainwindow.cpp:277
msgid ""
"\n"
"--- Process finished with exit code %1 ---"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"--- 进程结束，退出代码 %1 ---"

#: mainwindow.cpp:287
msgid ""
"\n"
"The installation is complete. Please wait about 10 minutes, then restart "
"your computer and enter the MOK password. Here's how: after restarting, when "
"the blue screen appears, press any key within 10 seconds, then go through "
"“Enroll MOK”, “Continue”, “Yes”, and then enter your MOK password. After "
"that, select “Reboot” to restart your computer. Then, type `lsmod | grep "
"nvidia` to check if NVIDIA has loaded successfully, and go to KDE System "
"Settings > About This System to see if your NVIDIA GPU model is displayed. "
"If the NVIDIA driver didn't load successfully, open the terminal, type sudo "
"akmods --force, then sudo dracut -v --force, and restart your computer to "
"complete the installation!"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"安装完成。请等待约 10 分钟，然后重启计算机并输入 MOK 密码。操作步骤如下：重启后，当蓝屏出现时，在 10 秒内按任意键，然后依次选择“Enroll MOK”、“Continue”、“Yes”，接着输入您设置的 MOK 密码。之后选择“Reboot”重启计算机。然后输入 `lsmod | grep nvidia` 检查 NVIDIA 是否加载成功，并前往 KDE 系统设置 > 关于本系统查看是否显示您的 NVIDIA GPU 型号。如果 NVIDIA 驱动未能成功加载，请打开终端，输入 sudo akmods --force，然后 sudo dracut -v --force，再重启计算机以完成安装！"

#: mainwindow.cpp:291
msgid ""
"The installation is complete. Please wait about 10 minutes, then restart "
"your computer to start using it！If the NVIDIA driver didn't load "
"successfully, open the terminal, type sudo akmods --force, then sudo dracut "
"-v --force, and restart your computer to complete the installation!"
msgstr ""
"安装完成。请等待约 10 分钟，然后重启计算机即可开始使用！如果 NVIDIA 驱动未能成功加载，请打开终端，输入 sudo akmods --force，然后 sudo dracut -v --force，再重启计算机以完成安装！"

#: mainwindow.cpp:294
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Installation log saved to:\n"
"/tmp/nvidia-driver-installer.log"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"安装日志已保存至：\n"
"/tmp/nvidia-driver-installer.log"

#: mainwindow.cpp:295
msgid "Success"
msgstr "成功"

#: mainwindow.cpp:297
msgid "Error"
msgstr "错误"

#: mainwindow.cpp:298
msgid ""
"Driver installation failed.\n"
"Check the log for details:\n"
"/tmp/nvidia-driver-installer.log"
msgstr ""
"驱动程序安装失败。\n"
"查看日志了解详情：\n"
"/tmp/nvidia-driver-installer.log"

#: mainwindow.cpp:316
msgid "Secure Boot Detected"
msgstr "检测到安全启动"

#: mainwindow.cpp:317
msgid ""
"Secure Boot is enabled on this system.\n"
"NVIDIA drivers must be signed to load.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to configure Machine Owner Key (MOK) now?"
msgstr ""
"此系统已启用安全启动。\n"
"NVIDIA 驱动程序需要签名才能加载。\n"
"\n"
"是否现在配置机器所有者密钥（MOK）？"

#: mainwindow.cpp:321
msgid "Configure MOK"
msgstr "配置 MOK"

#: mainwindow.cpp:322
msgid "Skip (Install anyway)"
msgstr "跳过（仍安装）"

#: mainwindow.cpp:331
msgid "Set MOK Password"
msgstr "设置 MOK 密码"

#: mainwindow.cpp:332
msgid ""
"Please enter a password for the Machine Owner Key (MOK).\n"
"You will need to enter this password after reboot in the MOK management "
"interface.\n"
"Password:"
msgstr ""
"请为机器所有者密钥（MOK）输入一个密码。\n"
"重启后您需要在 MOK 管理界面中输入此密码。\n"
"密码："

#: mainwindow.cpp:337
msgid "Password Required"
msgstr "需要密码"

#: mainwindow.cpp:338
msgid ""
"MOK configuration cancelled. You can still install the driver, but it may "
"not load with Secure Boot enabled."
msgstr ""
"已取消 MOK 配置。您仍可安装驱动，但在安全启动启用时可能无法加载。"

#: mainwindow.cpp:343
msgid "Confirm MOK Password"
msgstr "确认 MOK 密码"

#: mainwindow.cpp:344
msgid "Please re-enter the password to confirm:"
msgstr "请重新输入密码以确认："

#: mainwindow.cpp:347
msgid "Password Mismatch"
msgstr "密码不匹配"

#: mainwindow.cpp:348
msgid "Passwords do not match. MOK configuration cancelled."
msgstr "密码不匹配。MOK 配置已取消。"

#: mainwindow.cpp:354
msgid "MOK Configuration Failed"
msgstr "MOK 配置失败"

#: mainwindow.cpp:355
msgid ""
"Failed to set up MOK. You can still install the driver, but it may not load "
"with Secure Boot enabled."
msgstr ""
"设置 MOK 失败。您仍可安装驱动，但在安全启动启用时可能无法加载。"

#: mainwindow.cpp:360
msgid "MOK Configured"
msgstr "MOK 已配置"

#: mainwindow.cpp:361
msgid ""
"The Machine Owner Key has been imported successfully.\n"
"\n"
"When you reboot, the MOK management interface will appear.\n"
"Select 'Enroll MOK' -> 'Continue' -> 'Yes' and enter the password you just "
"set:\n"
"    %1\n"
"\n"
"After enrolling, the driver will load correctly."
msgstr ""
"机器所有者密钥已成功导入。\n"
"\n"
"重启后，MOK 管理界面将会出现。\n"
"依次选择“Enroll MOK” -> “Continue” -> “Yes”，然后输入您刚刚设置的密码：\n"
"    %1\n"
"\n"
"注册完成后，驱动程序将正常加载。"

#: mainwindow.cpp:117
msgid "MOK Configuration Log"
msgstr "MOK 配置日志"

#: mainwindow.cpp:138
msgid "Error: Cannot create temporary directory."
msgstr "错误：无法创建临时目录。"

#: mainwindow.cpp:148
msgid "Error: Cannot write temporary script."
msgstr "错误：无法写入临时脚本。"

#: mainwindow.cpp:274
msgid ""
"\n"
"--- MOK configuration finished with exit code %1 ---"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"--- MOK 配置完成，退出代码 %1 ---"

#: mainwindow.cpp:276
msgid "MOK configuration completed successfully."
msgstr "MOK 配置成功完成。"

#: mainwindow.cpp:278
msgid "MOK configuration failed. Please check the log for details."
msgstr "MOK 配置失败。请查看日志了解详情。"